F_ref_c7       refusal skipped (value STORED) while COLOR_B (port 7) is non-zero
F_ref_y1       refusal skipped while Y1 (port 2) is non-zero
F_ref_r55      refusal skipped while COLOR_R (port 5) holds 0x55
F_ref_cmd1     refusal skipped while COMMAND holds 1 (SET_RESOLUTION)
F_rd_c7        a PORT read while COLOR_B is non-zero falls into the write path
F_rd_cmd1      a PORT read while COMMAND holds 1 falls into the write path
F_ann_sign     no announce (latch unset) for a refused value with bit 63 set
F_ann_cmd1     no announce (latch unset) while COMMAND holds 1
F_cell_sh      effect 4 x width sh: a refusal by sh writes port[idata & 7]
F_cell_p5      effect 4 x previous selector 5: the refusal writes port[idata & 7]
F_cell_cmd0    effect 4 x COMMAND 0: the refusal writes port[idata & 7]
K_ref_x1       control: refusal skipped while X1 (port 1) is non-zero (V's first refusal holds X1=123)
K_ref_r        control: refusal skipped while COLOR_R is non-zero (P holds 0x2a)
K_cell_sb      control: effect 4 x width sb (V refuses 0xff by sb)
K_cell_p7      control: effect 4 x previous selector 7 (V's five later refusals)
J_ref_cmdlatch joint: refusal skipped while COMMAND != 0 AND latched (R's second refusal)
W_pred_ge7     weakened bound: 7 refused too
